    "text": "swxlocalsports.com\nwebsite\nCheney\nEastern Washington coach Aaron Best talks Boise State on the blue, UIW loss | Full Press Conference\n1 days ago\nCHENEY, Wash. — Following the close 10-point loss to No. 5 Incarnate Word on the road this past weekend, Eastern Washington head coach Aaron Best held a press conference ahead of the Eagles' Week 2 matchup at Boise State on Friday, Sept. 5, at 6 p.m. PT on the blue turf in Boise.",
